c7cbec2's or ISSUE-f9ced66a0e8835b8's territory.","Verify no missing requirement: every acceptance criterion (ac1-ac5) implied by the ISSUE is represented somewhere in contract/error/test sections with a consistent, non-contradictory treatment.","Confirm shared contract (ReviewSources) changes are consistently described the same way across contractDetails, dataModelChanges and errorPaths sections (no drifted method signature or error field between sections).","Produce the final verdict per the precedence rule based on findings and limitations collected across all substantive chunks."],"dependsOn":["contract-data-model","error-paths-and-tests","migration-and-alternatives","summary-scope-and-citations"],"purpose":"consistency"}],"coverageExplanation":"Four substantive chunks partition the LLD's inventory by implementation-responsibility grouping: (1) contract-data-model covers the interface/API/data-model units and is the dependency baseline others build on since all later claims rest on whether the described contracts match real code; (2) error-paths-and-tests covers error/edge/invariant and test-strategy units, verified against the contract baseline and the ISSUE's acceptance needs; (3) migration-and-alternatives covers migration steps, backward compat, and all three alternatives (including the two alternativesConsidered array-item units and chosenAlternative/openQuestions), verified against the same contract baseline; (4) summary-scope-and-citations covers the narrative/framing units, the duplicate document:line:24 TOC/heading unit, and every citation unit, checking traceability back to the originating ISSUE and citation accuracy. The final consistency chunk depends on all four substantive chunks, has empty selectors (whole-artifact check), and produces the overall verdict.","finalConsistencyChunkId":"final-consistency","coverage":[{"unitId":"/body/summary","chunkIds":["summary-scope-and-citations"]},{"unitId":"/body/hldContextSlice","chunkIds":["summary-scope-and-